@startuml
title Acknowledged event: delivery becomes verifiable

participant "ESP32" as MCU
participant "PC" as PC

MCU -> PC : event notify_id = 81
PC -> PC : validate and record
PC --> MCU : ack notify_id = 81

note over MCU, PC
  The id lets the sender retry a lost event
  and lets the receiver drop a duplicate.
end note
@enduml
